flowchart TD
    A[Company Documents<br/>PDF / DOCX / MD / TXT] --> B[Document Loader<br/>PyPDF / Docx2txt / Markdown / Text]
    B --> C[Chunking<br/>Recursive Character Splitter]
    C --> D[Embeddings<br/>sentence-transformers MiniLM]
    D --> E{Vector Store}
    E --> E1[FAISS]
    E --> E2[ChromaDB]
    C --> F[BM25 Keyword Index]

    Q[User Query] --> M[Conversation Memory<br/>Condense follow-up question]
    M --> R1[Vector / Semantic Search]
    M --> R2[BM25 Keyword Search]
    E1 -.-> R1
    E2 -.-> R1
    F -.-> R2

    R1 --> H[Hybrid Fusion<br/>Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
    R2 --> H
    H --> RR[Reranking<br/>Cross-Encoder]
    RR --> CTX[Relevant Context + Sources]
    CTX --> LLM{LLM Provider}
    LLM --> L1[OpenAI GPT]
    LLM --> L2[Google Gemini]
    M --> LLM

    LLM --> ANS[Grounded Answer + Source Citations]
    ANS --> UI[Streamlit Chat UI]
    UI --> Q
